  "limitations": [
    "Catalog probe used the production Elixir create relation and BuildCatalogAdmission checks with the baseline create schema. It did not start the hosted endpoint, restricted Oban processor, or native compiler.",
    "PostgreSQL was isolated on loopback and the processor role was present for effective function ACL checks.",
    "Two initial compile configurations failed due to a macOS tmp symlink and the hosted manifest requiring deps/oban under the source root. Final tests used a revision-pinned hosted snapshot with an owned deps link and the exact migration.",
